UID:8fefa092c35075df@role-bankruptcy.maine-government-feeds
DTSTAMP:20260910T162239Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260910
SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] LGBTQ Veterans Day - September 20
DESCRIPTION:WHEREAS\n\, generations of lesbian\, gay\, bisexual\, transgen
 der\, queer\, and other LGBTQ veterans have served the United States with 
 courage\, professionalism\, and distinction in every branch of the Armed F
 orces\; and\nWHEREAS\n\, LGBTQ servicemembers and veterans have contribute
 d to the defense of the nation even during periods when military policy re
 quired many to conceal who they were or subjected them to discrimination\,
  investigation\, discharge\, or unequal treatment\; and\nWHEREAS\n\, Maine
  is home to veterans\, servicemembers\, military families\, public servant
 s\, and national security professionals whose service strengthens both the
  state and the nation\; and\nWHEREAS\n\, recognizing the service and sacri
 fice of LGBTQ veterans helps ensure that all who have worn the uniform are
  treated with dignity\, receive the benefits and support they have earned\
 , and remain connected to the communities they served\; and\nWHEREAS\n\, L
 GBTQ Veterans Day provides an opportunity to honor veterans living today\,
  remember those who served before them\, and recognize the continuing cont
 ributions of LGBTQ veterans to the civic life\, security\, and strength of
  Maine\;\nNOW\, THEREFORE\n\, be it resolved that I\, Janet T. Mills\, Gov
 ernor of the State of Maine\, do hereby proclaim September 20\, 2026 as\nL
 GBTQ Veterans Day\nthroughout the State of Maine\, and I encourage all Mai
 ne people to recognize the service\, sacrifice\, and contributions of LGBT
 Q veterans to our state and our nation.\nIn testimony whereof\, I have cau
 sed\nthe Great Seal of the State to be\nhereunto affixed GIVEN under my\nh
 and at Augusta this second day\nof September Two Thousand Twenty-Six\nhttp
 ://www.maine.gov/governor/mills/official_documents/proclamations/2026-09-l
 gbtq-veterans-day-september-20
URL:http://www.maine.gov/governor/mills/official_documents/proclamations/2
 026-09-lgbtq-veterans-day-september-20
CATEGORIES:Curated Role Feeds
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
